{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0053_1000_007ior", "source_sha256": "92557bbc4153f9c8cbaaab064c465fcc2f87eb77cd894abbceac7ab83bf8edc9", "ja": "ちょっと、{$P$}、\nまだ仕事終わらないの！？", "zh": "喂，{$P$}，\n你的工作还没结束吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0053_1001_p", "source_sha256": "d95b60497098ed4e4cb2bfcd63807edb32e0dc4632e280dbb5ef8a327408f03d", "ja": "すまない、今日はかなり忙しくて……\nって、伊織こそ、まだ着替えてなかったのか？", "zh": "抱歉，今天的事情实在有点多……\n咦？伊织你才是，怎么还没把衣服换下来？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0053_1002_007ior", "source_sha256": "0b7c9eac455769bd1318e94034e999ccd9f59c7500b9abc7fb777b48fcddbc91", "ja": "ええ、ちょっと……。ほら、あれよ。\n今日のステージの反省会、しなくちゃと思って。", "zh": "嗯，该怎么说……就是那个啦。\n我觉得有必要检讨一下今天的表演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0053_1003_007ior", "source_sha256": "90db835c0e1345c9fbc75a62df0fe96167d0cc48f16bbda53c8d9d479c8559f1", "ja": "今日の構成、なかなか悪くなかったわ。サビで\nピンスポットが当たる演出も盛り上がったし。", "zh": "今天的整体流程还挺不错的。\n进到副歌以后打聚光灯的效果也让台下的反应更热烈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0053_1004_p", "source_sha256": "33928772c9ba3cc8830d616b410ad1e31dcb25092f0705577ad6524dbdf7af27", "ja": "はは、ありがとう。おほめにあずかれて嬉しいよ。", "zh": "哈哈，谢谢。很高兴能被你称赞。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0053_1005_007ior", "source_sha256": "7bdbf9214462009f9ee7fb24bd3d7862fb0b81a677df932ef45364cabc142407", "ja": "あっ、ほめてるって言っても、ちょっとよ、ちょっと！\nこれで調子にのって油断したりしちゃダメよ！？", "zh": "啊，我虽然是在称赞你，但也只是稍微讲讲，稍微而已！\n你可别这样就得意忘形，掉以轻心喔！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0053_1006_007ior", "source_sha256": "524d936fbad2380bd0ec3f778e022555c79a95e688e7ce89c1100de2db9a4522", "ja": "ただ、少しくらいはねぎらってあげても\nいいかしらって、思ってはいるけど……。", "zh": "我只是想说，\n稍微慰劳一下你的辛劳也无妨……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0053_1007_p", "source_sha256": "63911539a43719f3265cca8db0bce9b15f336ebf129504a93cfec922796eac13", "ja": "おっ、それは、ますます嬉しいな！　じゃあ、\nさっそくだけど、そっちの企画書の束を取ってくれ。", "zh": "喔，听你这么说让我更高兴了！\n那么，这就麻烦你帮我把那叠企划书拿过来吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0053_1008_007ior", "source_sha256": "578a5a3d33d11e1b2936ec512d8aef8820ab07fd8d8a01b555a5e25c364cf82f", "ja": "これ？　仕方ないわね、はいどうぞ……\nって、なんで私が雑用をしなきゃいけないのよっ！？", "zh": "这个吗？真拿你没办法，给你……\n不对啊，为什么我要在这边帮你打杂啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0053_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d6c43e89206bde26c4ce37af358004f18e7e819fb6fd7c3abcdf7ebef7172fc8", "ja": "え。だって、ねぎらうって、\n手伝ってくれるってことじゃないのか？", "zh": "咦？你说要慰劳我，\n不就是要帮我忙的意思吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0053_1010_007ior", "source_sha256": "1787d62dbdbb3e8529bf6e05efc3fc36458a65e6cbe03c44a1a7cff8b0f0644f", "ja": "違うわよ！　アンタは早く仕事を終わらせて、\n私の買い物に付き合うのっ！", "zh": "才不是！是你要尽快把工作完成，\n陪我去购物才对！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0053_1011_p", "source_sha256": "60beb126ff573b666051594bfec8b90d93bdc1caf6bdbedf0a352c3bdf1b9c5c", "ja": "それは……ねぎらいなのか？", "zh": "这样……算是慰劳吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0053_1012_007ior", "source_sha256": "a1148693c45ed2fcf4f80d3d4cbd85b05470c64af482057d5269271fdd0ca4b3", "ja": "あら。この超絶美少女の伊織ちゃんと、お買い物に行け\nるなんて、ねぎらい以外のなにものでもないでしょ？", "zh": "哎呀，让你陪伴我这超绝美少女伊织去购物，\n这不叫慰劳不然叫什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0053_1013_p", "source_sha256": "4a05135815fbcad09ea3e05d1d5caed9bec460aaa41f6250b9c52b00246483da", "ja": "まあ……そういう解釈もある気はするけど……。\nそれ、いつもと変わらなくないか？", "zh": "唉……这样说好像也没错啦……\n不过，那不就跟平常没两样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0053_1014_007ior", "source_sha256": "30283642ac65137ad95da6c34dd608b1a7572b215e93df0efabb36eeb69fafb3", "ja": "変わらなくっても、いいの！　ほら早く仕事、\n終わらせなさいよ……もうっ、手伝ってあげるからっ！", "zh": "跟平常一样有什么不好！\n好了，快把工作完成……真是的，我来帮你啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
